    "native-sac",
    "account-created-by-contract-call"
  ],
  "why": "From Protocol 26 an XLM transfer through the Stellar Asset Contract to an account that does not exist creates it. The ledger has an account creation with no CreateAccount operation; readers that only record account creation from that operation miss the new account.",
